# Coolify Configuration Directory
# This directory contains Coolify-specific deployment configurations

# Files in this directory:
# - coolify-docker-compose.yml: Docker Compose configuration for Coolify
# - coolify.json: Coolify application configuration
# - COOLIFY-DEPLOYMENT.md: Complete deployment guide

# Environment Variables Required:
# - NODE_ENV=production
# - DATABASE_URL=postgresql://postgres:password@postgres:5432/totaggroup  
# - SESSION_SECRET=your-super-secure-session-secret
# - POSTGRES_PASSWORD=your-secure-postgres-password
# - RESEND_API_KEY=your-resend-api-key (optional)

# Deployment Steps:
# 1. Push code to Git repository
# 2. Create new Docker Compose resource in Coolify
# 3. Configure environment variables
# 4. Set domain name
# 5. Deploy

# The application will be available at your configured domain
# Default admin credentials: admin/admin123 (change after deployment)